msgid "快速开始"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/quick_start.md:37
msgid "**运行tutorials中的向量加法示例验证结果**"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/quick_start.md:39
msgid "向量加法示例：[01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) 通过对比Triton算子与PyTorch原生计算的输出结果，证明昇腾NPU设备可正确调用Triton算子并保证计算精度。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/quick_start.md:41
msgid "⚠️ 下述命令需在bash环境下执行。若使用POSIX sh，请将 `source` 替换为 `.`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/quick_start.md:43
msgid "# Set the CANN environment variables (using the root user's default installation path `/usr/local/Ascend` as an example)\n"
"source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh\n"
"# Clone the triton-ascend source repository and examples\n"
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"# Run the tutorials sample\n"
"python3 ./triton-ascend/third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py\n"
""
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/quick_start.md:52
msgid "观察到类似的输出即说明环境配置正确。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/quick_start.md:54
msgid "tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\n"
"tensor([0.8329, 1.0024, 1.3639,  ..., 1.0796, 1.0406, 1.5811], device='npu:0')\n"
"The maximum difference between torch and triton is 0.0\n"
""
msgstr ""

